data: {"id": "3766c88428634b6d-final", "run_id": "3766c88428634b6d", "seq": 623, "ts_ms": 1789360122809, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v11/workload` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-v11/workload 处于 CreateContainerConfigError 状态，持续 Pending 且未恢复 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-v11/workload` 状态为 Pending，容器 `app` 等待原因为 `CreateContainerConfigError` | 确认核心故障现象 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | 容器 `app` 报错：`couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input` | 定位配置缺失的直接原因 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container=app, reason=CreateContainerConfigError) 值为 1 | 独立确认容器因配置错误被拦截 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` (container=app) 值为 1，`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 0 | 确认 Pod 长期处于未就绪状态且未发生重试 |\n\n证据 1 与 2 共同指向容器因配置项缺失导致无法创建；证据 3 从 Prometheus 指标角度独立验证了 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态的持续性，与 K8s 状态完全一致，且重启次数为 0 排除了应用崩溃等运行时故障。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 引用了 ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input 中不存在的 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 在容器创建前校验失败 → 容器状态设为 CreateContainerConfigError → Pod 处于 Pending 且应用逻辑未执行\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod Spec 定义了引用 ConfigMap `aiops-case-v11/workload-input` 中不存在的 `unavailable-key`**，导致 kubelet 无法完成容器环境配置加载 [证据 #2]。该配置错误直接触发了 `CreateContainerConfigError` 异常 [证据 #1, #3]，使得 Pod 无法进入运行状态。现有证据充分且相互印证，无需进一步补充。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 54.9s\n├─ 问题定位: 15.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v11/workload: 32.8s (Evidence 23.4s, RCA 9.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v11/workload**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 54.866, "metrics": {"run_id": "3766c88428634b6d", "mttr": {"value": "54.9s", "seconds": 54.87225341796875, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 54872.25341796875, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 51719.403982162476, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 7226.142883300781, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2798.8998889923096}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15066.674947738647, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 32805.95803260803, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion":